<section class="card"><span class="badge"><?=e($c['status'])?></span><h2><?=e($c['title'])?></h2><p><?=e($c['programme'].' · '.$c['study_period'])?> · <?=count($students)?> students · <?=count($rows)?> module marks</p><p>Dean: <?=e($settings['dean'])?> · President: <?=e($settings['president'])?> · Issue date: <?=e($c['issued_on'])?></p><div class="ac-toolbar"><a class="button" href="?page=rt_print&amp;cohort_id=<?=$id?>" target="_blank">Preview / print all students</a><a class="button secondary" href="?page=rt_csv&amp;cohort_id=<?=$id?>">Export uploaded marks</a></div><p>Print A4 portrait, 100% scale, browser headers/footers off, duplex on the long edge. Each student has one front and one information back. Preview checks page fit before enabling Print.</p></section>
